flowchart TD
    A([Start])
    --> B[Edit Matching Criteria]
    --> C[Evaluate proposed criteria]
    --> D[Calculate current vs proposed population]
    --> E[Show affected employee count]
    --> F[Show gain/loss where available]
    --> G{High impact?}

    G -- Yes --> H[Require confirmation]
    --> I{Confirmed?}
    I -- No --> J([Cancel])
    I -- Yes --> K[Save criteria]

    G -- No --> K

    K --> L[Mark User Group pending synchronization]
    --> M([Completed])
